  "text": "I've generated over 3 billion views for some of the most boring brands on the internet, like instant ramen, software tools, and cellphone plans. \n\nAfter years of doing this, I've come to realize that virality has nothing to do with the content itself, and everything to do with how the human brain works. \n\nIn this video, I break down the 6 psychological principles I've used to make almost anything go viral.\n\nWork with me:\nhttps://shortscut.com/\n\nConnect with me: \nhttps://www.instagram.com/tuann_lee/\nhttps://x.com/tuanle\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/tuan-lee/",
